source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: With two `\\` pairs in one token Jira shows the first and breaks on the second; jiro reads two literal backslashes and a hard break. The renderer avoids the question by never writing a pair.
-- input.jira --
C:\\dir\\file
-- rendered.html --
<p>C:\\dir<br class="atl-forced-newline" />file</p>
-- want.md --
C:\\\\dir\
file
-- warnings.json --
[]
